# Strict ingest trusts the source region's verdict instead of judging the body
# by the receiver's own policy.
MODULE: StrictAdmitsOnlyServableJudgedBySourcePolicy
TARGET: StrictAdmitsOnlyServable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: strict ingest skips the receiver's policy
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
            THEN /\ IF Servable(stamp[e]) /\ body[e] = "Good"
--- REPLACE
            THEN /\ IF Servable(stamp[e])
--- END
